  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dejamos algunas imágenes de lo que fue el Evento Comunal de Cueca de Establecimientos Educacionales, organizado por la Escuela Encarnación Olivares.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La jornada permitió destacar el talento, entusiasmo y amor por nuestras tradiciones de estudiantes de distintos establecimientos de la comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏆\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tbe/1/16/1f3c6.png\"/> Cueca Lugareña: Antonia Gallozo y Daniel Vera, de la Escuela Francisco Cortés.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏆\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tbe/1/16/1f3c6.png\"/> Cueca Básica Urbana: Alison Muñoz y Vicente Ayancán, de la Escuela Nueva Pennsylvania.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏆\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tbe/1/16/1f3c6.png\"/> Cueca Urbana Enseñanza Media: Danae Ruiz y Víctor Villegas, del Liceo Carelmapu.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👏\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfe/1/16/1f44f.png\"/><img alt=\"🇨🇱\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tc4/1/16/1f1e8_1f1f1.png\"/> Felicitamos a todas y todos los estudiantes que participaron y contribuyeron a mantener viva nuestra danza nacional.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13056\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/dt7fqwqefc0hpe5/agc_8939_1024x683_z7zqb97zfj.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13065\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/2dfpp4gsdqrpsjm/agc_9033_1024x683_nu9b3wbj24.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13074\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/77ld8j76vls1fwm/agc_9149_1024x683_khr81qvlu9.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13058\" data-id=\"13058\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/ouilbttruvym6kx/agc_8946_1024x683_y9ddqnh82t.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13059\" data-id=\"13059\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl